p asks for it itself (with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy"},{"type":"text","text":") before every presentation — in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":"; without one, iOS asks for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode instead. A presentation answering several documents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at once ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)"},{"type":"text","text":") asks once: its holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys share one authentication context for that call only."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"holderUserPresence"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/tagPrefix":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/tagprefix","title":"tagPrefix","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Prefixes every key’s Keychain application